    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254-a1">

                <pb facs="0349" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg251"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proclamation.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Taku</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-06-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The admirals and senior officers of the allied powers in China desire to let it
                    be known to all viceroys and authorities on* coast, river provinces, and cities
                    in China <pb facs="0350" n="252" xml:id="pg252"/> that they intend use of their
                    arms only against the Boxers and those people who oppose them in their march to
                    Pekin for the rescue of their fellow countrymen.</p>
                <p>Published by request of the senior admiral at Taku.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Joaquim Maria Travassos
                            Valdez</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Consul-General for Portugal and
                            Senior Consul.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Senior
                            Consulate</hi>, <placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-06-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 23,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Shanghai, China, July 3, 1900.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
